# Trivy suppressions.
#
# The Security workflow runs Trivy with `scanners: secret,misconfig` only, and
# deliberately does not scan dependencies — the workflow explains why at length,
# but the short version is that a mod's classpath is Mojang's and NeoForged's,
# pinned with strict version constraints, and none of it ships in the jar.
#
# So this file is for secret and misconfiguration findings. If one ever needs
# suppressing, it needs a reason written next to it — a finding silenced here
# leaves no trace anywhere else.
#
# Format: one finding ID per line, each with a comment explaining why.
# Currently empty.
